posts.body:
@aidandowen
It's nice that you want to share your work, but it's not cool to post your own resources in someone else's thread.  In addtion, Avery's terms of service forbid reposting of edits of her work.  I have, threfore, removed your images.
I would be good, if you want to share your work, to open your own thread to post the X-Men sprites, but you cannot post the wheelchair one.
